---
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
import { SERVICES } from "../data/services";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden bg-forest-950 text-forest-100">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.16] dot-grid-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-page relative py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.7fr_0.8fr_0.9fr]">
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <a href="/" aria-label="PESONA Kabupaten Klungkung — beranda">
          <Logo variant="light" />
        </a>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-forest-100/70">
          Konsep satu kanal untuk belajar pajak, mengurus administrasi, dan menumbuhkan usaha di
          Kabupaten Klungkung. Dijelaskan dengan bahasa yang manusiawi dan alur yang transparan.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="badge-dark">Konsep platform</span>
          <span class="badge-dark">Data ilustrasi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-forest-200/70">
          Jelajahi
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/tentang">Tentang PESONA</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/edukasi">Pusat edukasi</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/pajak">Jenis pajak daerah</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/kalkulator">Kalkulator simulasi</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/usaha">Citta Karya</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white" href="/dashboard">Contoh dashboard</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-forest-200/70">
          Layanan
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          {
            SERVICES.map((service) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  class="text-forest-100/75 transition hover:text-white"
                  href={`/layanan/${service.slug}`}
                >
                  {service.shortTitle}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-forest-200/70">
          Kontak konsep
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm text-forest-100/75">
          <li class="flex gap-2.5">
            <Icon name="ph:map-pin" size={17} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-honey-300" />
            <span>MPP Klungkung, Bali<br /><span class="text-xs text-forest-200/75">lokasi ilustrasi</span></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5">
            <Icon name="ph:envelope-simple" size={17} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-honey-300" />
            <a class="transition hover:text-white" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2.5">
            <Icon name="ph:clock" size={17} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-honey-300" />
            <span>{SITE.hours}</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/tentang#pengembangan"
          data-login-open
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/10"
        >
          Masuk ke PESONA
          <Icon name="ph:arrow-up-right" size={15} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-white/10 pt-7">
      <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-forest-100/70">
        © {year} PESONA · Konsep platform TRI CITTA MAHOTTAMA untuk Kabupaten Klungkung. Situs ini
        bukan situs resmi Pemerintah Kabupaten Klungkung. Seluruh angka, nama, status, dan jadwal
        adalah simulasi. Izin, sertifikasi, dan pemungutan pajak tetap menjadi kewenangan instansi
        berwenang.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3 text-[0.68rem] text-forest-200/65 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <p>Dibangun sebagai situs statis dengan Astro, Tailwind CSS, dan Phosphor Icons.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
          <a class="transition hover:text-forest-100" href="/tentang#batas">Batas &amp; peran</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a class="transition hover:text-forest-100" href="/tentang#pengembangan">Status pengembangan</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a class="transition hover:text-forest-100" href="/layanan/konsultasi">Kanal konsultasi</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a class="transition hover:text-forest-100" href="/peta-situs">Peta situs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
